user.description:
Edit passive attach/exclude rules and define functions or entity-bound or automation-reported situations. Exclusions always win. Enable Preview to inspect rule matches, function requirements and candidate decisions without saving, then turn it off to apply. Policy controls recipients, channels, quiet hours, reminders, escalation and digests. Notifications need an enabled consumer automation. Situation sources must report evidence loss as unavailable. Timing values are seconds except coalescing count. See README examples.

